        <p>_ The Lion Fouudry Co., Ltd., KirkintilLick, wrote informiog the Guardiaua that the extra cog of making the staima.F.es 3ft. wide instead of 2tt. 41 tor the male and female hospitals would be £319 93. This they t•usted would be satisfactory, and they would be glad to hear if. they might now proceed with the work.</p>
